OL,3,AEgyptian journalist Lina Attalah
OL,4,Adetained after court orders news site's
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe editor-in-chief of the independent
OL,8,FEgyptian news outlet Mada Masr has been
OL,9,Ftaken into custody after a court
OL,10,Fconvicted her of managing an unlicensed
OL,11,Fwebsite and ordered its closure, her
OL,12,Flawyers say.
OL,14,FLina Attalah will be held until she
OL,15,Fpays the fine of 3m Egyptian pounds
OL,16,F($53,500; #40,100) also handed down by
OL,17,Fthe New Cairo Misdemeanours Court. It
OL,18,Fwas the maximum possible penalty for
OL,19,Fthe charge, which she had rejected.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
