OL,3,AEgyptian journalist Lina Attalah
OL,4,Adetained after court orders news site's
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe human rights group Amnesty
OL,8,FInternational said the verdict
OL,9,Frepresented "a crushing blow to press
OL,10,Ffreedom".
OL,12,FIt comes only weeks after six
OL,13,Fjournalists working for the independent
OL,14,Ffact-checking platform Matsda2sh were
OL,15,Fcharged with belonging to the outlawed
OL,16,FMuslim Brotherhood.
